## Why This Is Asked
This question probes concrete E2E strategies for feature flags in multi-tenant, latency-sensitive systems, ensuring isolation, observability, and fast rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Feature flags, canary rollout, rollback semantics
- Multi-tenant data isolation and tenant-scoped routing
- End-to-end with API mocks, network latency, and analytics verification
